{"id":"ma_quina","lemma":"máquina","pos":"noun","rank":870,"glosses":["machine"],"ipa":"/ˈmakina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"máquinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-m%C3%A1quina.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hice andar la máquina.","en":"I got the machine running.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735744"},{"text":"Estas máquinas no funcionan ahora.","en":"These machines aren't working now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526747"},{"text":"Esa máquina está averiada.","en":"The machine is out of order.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707348"},{"text":"Este hospital tiene muchas máquinas nuevas.","en":"This hospital has a lot of new equipment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189074"},{"text":"Ella está arreglando la máquina.","en":"She's fixing the machine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639601"}]}